        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conditions d'utilisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's %@ per month" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soit %@ par mois"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The best voice model for your language and iPhone. It downloads while you finish setting up, and you can change it in Models." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding language screen, small print under the model name and size: the model is chosen for the user, downloads in the background, and can be changed in the Models tab (#649).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le meilleur modèle vocal pour votre langue et votre iPhone. Il se télécharge pendant que vous terminez la configuration, et vous pourrez le changer dans Modèles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The correct spelling" : {
      "comment" : "Section header above the canonical-spelling field.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’orthographe correcte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictation failed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La dictée a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictation failed. Tap the microphone to try again." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when a dictation fails for a reason the app cannot name. Deliberately names no cause (issues #313, #320).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La dictée a échoué. Touchez le micro pour réessayer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download continues if you leave the app, but much more slowly." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding variant of the model preparation screen (#675): replaces 'Please stay on this page and do not leave the app.' while the onboarding's download runs. The download survives leaving the app, but iOS throttles it in the background.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le téléchargement continue si vous quittez l'app, mais beaucoup plus lentement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download stalled. Check your internet connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Model download error when no bytes arrive for the stall window (issue #207).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le téléchargement s'est interrompu. Vérifiez votre connexion Internet et réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each update, the first preparation of this model takes about %lld minutes. Later ones take a few seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Preparation screen: names how long a first Core ML compile takes for models where it has been measured (issue #432). The argument is a number of minutes, always 2 or more. The wait returns after every install, app update and OS update (issue #542).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après chaque mise à jour, la première préparation de ce modèle prend environ %lld minutes. Les suivantes ne prennent que quelques secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each update, the first preparation of this model takes under a minute. Later ones take a few seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Preparation screen: shown for a model whose measured first compile is under a minute, such as Medium at 32s (issue #432). The wait returns after every install, app update and OS update (issue #542).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après chaque mise à jour, la première préparation de ce modèle prend moins d'une minute. Les suivantes ne prennent que quelques secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download could not resume. Please try again." : {
      "comment" : "Model download error when a ranged response could not be appended to the partial already on disk (issue #449).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le téléchargement n'a pas pu reprendre. Réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keyboard will be detected automatically" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le clavier sera détecté automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lifetime purchase covers every current and future Pro feature that runs on your device or on a server you provide. Any feature relying on Dictus infrastructure is a separate offering." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'achat à vie couvre toutes les fonctionnalités Pro, actuelles et futures, qui s'exécutent sur votre appareil ou sur un serveur que vous fournissez. Toute fonctionnalité reposant sur l'infrastructure Dictus relève d'une offre distincte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is busy on a call. Try again once the call ends." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when a dictation cannot start because a phone call holds the microphone (issue #313).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le micro est occupé par un appel. Réessayez une fois l'appel terminé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is not available right now. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when the audio hardware reports no usable input format (issue #313).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le micro n'est pas disponible pour le moment. Réessayez dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone stopped responding. Close Dictus and open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when the audio engine reports running but captures no samples, and a forced restart does not recover it (issue #313).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le micro ne répond plus. Fermez Dictus puis rouvrez-le."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model (%@) is downloading now. It continues if you leave the app, but iOS slows it down a lot. To have it ready sooner, stay in Dictus, except to turn on the keyboard in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding popup message (#675). The argument is the model's size (~483 MB). The next step sends the user to Settings, hence the exception.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le modèle (%@) se télécharge maintenant. Il continue si vous quittez l'app, mais iOS le ralentit fortement. Pour qu'il soit prêt plus vite, restez dans Dictus, sauf pour activer le clavier dans Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model download is incomplete. Please try again." : {
      "comment" : "Model download error when a required file is missing after download (issue #207).",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le téléchargement du modèle est incomplet. Veuillez réessayer."
          }
